      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 1. Continuation of Department; Commissioner. There is continued\nin the Executive Office of the Mayor a Department of Employment\n(\"Department\"). The head of the Department shall be Commissioner of\nEmployment, who shall be appointed by the Mayor and who shall serve at the\nMayor's pleasure.",
